WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
One view leaves a line of possible contacts.
Particles can lose support at the true contact.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
APCL restores support along the unresolved direction.
The true contact is marked in gold.

00:07.000 --> 00:13.300
The robot reorients the grasped object.
A second view supplies new information.

00:13.300 --> 00:18.000
